  "summary": "Malicious code in notafollower122 (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook reads the AWS ECS container metadata endpoint (ECS_CONTAINER_METADATA_URI_V4/task) to collect the cluster name, AWS account ID, task ARN, and container image names, then POSTs the entire report to the external host hxxps://mourner-slot-explicit[.]ngrok-free[.]dev. This exfiltrates cloud-infrastructure metadata from any environment where the package is installed.",
